== Effects ==
* {{E|Bomb}}s placed by Isaac explode in 0.66 seconds instead of 1.5 seconds.
* {{dlc|r+}} Bombs deal +15 damage.

== Notes ==
* If Isaac leaves and re-enters a room after placing a bomb, its explosion timer would not be affected by the trinket.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Blood Bombs}}: Bombs placed by using health will explode while Isaac is still invincible.
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Isaac's bombs deal +30 damage. If Isaac has both the golden trinket and the Box, the increase is +50.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Anarchist Cookbook}} / {{i|Best Friend}} / {{i|Bob's Brain}} / {{i|Epic Fetus}} / {{i|Kamikaze!}}: No effect.
* {{i|Bomber Boy|r+}} / {{i|Scatter Bombs|r+}}: The +15 bonus is applied prior to the bomb damage multipliers.
* {{i|Book of Virtues}}: None of the bomb-spawning wisps are affected.
* {{i|Dr. Fetus}}: Bombs from Dr. Fetus also explode more quickly.
** {{dlc|r+}} Damage is not increased. The bonus is applied only to manually placed bombs.

== Trivia ==
* This trinket originated in ''Antibirth'', where it was originally called [[anti:Exploded Firecracker|Exploded Firecracker]].

